{"path":"eval/cases/comprehende-50/expected.md","ref":"ef1e688be084667a7f76ce365dfbe44bba1f7f55","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":1,"text":"# comprehende-50: Add an Export branch for uploading the report"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":3,"text":"PR #50. No ticket, no comments."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":5,"text":"## Story"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":6,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":7,"text":"- Title: the PR title."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":8,"text":"- Why: present, from the PR. The skill had no path for a user who asks to upload the report. Do not add a motive about sharing outside localhost."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":9,"text":"- Size: small."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":10,"text":"- Parts: 1 or 2. Groups: 2."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":12,"text":"## Groups"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":14,"text":"1. Export branch in the skill: `skills-next/comprehende/SKILL.md` and its identical copy `.agents/skills/comprehende/SKILL.md`. The summary says the copy is identical."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":15,"text":"2. PR publishing in `AGENTS.md`. No `dependsOn` to group 1. It is repo process that can be read alone."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":16,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":17,"text":"## Must state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":18,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":19,"text":"- The PR says agents publish with VibeDrop (`@vibedrop/cli`) and use a VibeDrop skill. `AGENTS.md` at head uses an anonymous Netlify deploy and puts the URL and password in the PR body. No VibeDrop skill is added."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":20,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":21,"text":"## Good to state"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":22,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":23,"text":"- Unclaimed Netlify sites last one hour, so the review link in a PR body stops working after that."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":24,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":25,"text":"## Must not"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":27,"text":"- Do not split the two `SKILL.md` copies by folder."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":28,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":29,"text":"## Baseline"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":30,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":31,"text":"- 6 of 6 runs stated the VibeDrop claim."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":32,"text":"- 4 of 6 chained the `AGENTS.md` group to the skill group with `dependsOn`, which the grader marked major."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":34,"text":"## case.json"},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":36,"text":"- `together`: both `SKILL.md` copies."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":37,"text":"- `apart`: `AGENTS.md` and the skill."},{"sha":"1e1081c3f779347d20577b83b6fe11bf66b08770","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790347107,"line":38,"text":"- Added the VibeDrop claim."}]}
